1
00:01:49,840 --> 00:01:50,520
Shiya.

2
00:01:52,240 --> 00:01:52,840
Sorry.

3
00:01:52,840 --> 00:01:53,560
I'm late.

4
00:01:53,720 --> 00:01:54,450
That's okay.

5
00:02:08,479 --> 00:02:09,400
All these years,

6
00:02:09,400 --> 00:02:11,120
I've owed you a proper date.

7
00:02:12,960 --> 00:02:13,640
We

8
00:02:13,640 --> 00:02:15,880
really haven't had a meal alone together.

9
00:02:15,880 --> 00:02:18,520
It's always either Jingyan or Peining.

10
00:02:22,720 --> 00:02:23,880
Hurry up, Peining.

11
00:02:25,480 --> 00:02:26,120
Over here.

12
00:02:31,840 --> 00:02:33,079
The traffic was terrible.

13
00:02:33,079 --> 00:02:34,240
Hope you didn't wait too long.

14
00:02:34,240 --> 00:02:34,840
Waiter.

15
00:02:34,840 --> 00:02:36,840
Two more sets of tableware, please.

16
00:03:02,440 --> 00:03:03,770
Why are you guys so late?

17
00:03:05,120 --> 00:03:06,400
It's all Pei Ning's fault.

18
00:03:06,400 --> 00:03:07,960
I said we should ride the motorcycle,

19
00:03:07,960 --> 00:03:09,360
but he insisted on driving.

20
00:03:09,360 --> 00:03:11,280
I was afraid Shiya would drink too much,

21
00:03:11,280 --> 00:03:12,440
and the wind would give her a headache on the motorcycle.

22
00:03:12,440 --> 00:03:14,100
I am the one taking Shiya home.

23
00:03:19,760 --> 00:03:20,360
Brother,

24
00:03:21,079 --> 00:03:21,740
from now on,

25
00:03:21,960 --> 00:03:22,720
let me do it.

26
00:03:27,520 --> 00:03:29,200
Neither of you should fight over it.

27
00:03:29,200 --> 00:03:30,280
Shiya is mine.

28
00:03:35,120 --> 00:03:36,760
Today's theme

29
00:03:36,760 --> 00:03:37,480
is

30
00:03:37,880 --> 00:03:39,079
to celebrate Pei Song

31
00:03:39,160 --> 00:03:40,820
and Shiya being single again.

32
00:03:43,600 --> 00:03:44,079
Come.

33
00:03:47,880 --> 00:03:48,440
Pei Song,

34
00:03:48,880 --> 00:03:49,880
raise your glass.

35
00:03:51,680 --> 00:03:52,200
Shiya.

36
00:03:53,000 --> 00:03:54,040
I thought today

37
00:03:54,880 --> 00:03:56,560
was just the two of us.

38
00:03:59,200 --> 00:04:00,600
We're already divorced.

39
00:04:01,000 --> 00:04:02,930
It's not appropriate to eat alone.

40
00:04:05,000 --> 00:04:05,840
Do you really have to push things

41
00:04:05,840 --> 00:04:07,000
this far?

42
00:04:11,920 --> 00:04:13,380
I don't know what you mean.

43
00:04:13,560 --> 00:04:14,400
Do you really not understand,

44
00:04:14,400 --> 00:04:15,720
or are you just pretending?

45
00:04:15,720 --> 00:04:16,560
Sorry.

46
00:04:17,079 --> 00:04:18,610
I really don't understand.

47
00:04:25,600 --> 00:04:26,080
Cheers.

48
00:04:26,800 --> 00:04:27,320
Cheers.

49
00:04:27,680 --> 00:04:28,240
Come on.

50
00:04:34,640 --> 00:04:35,920
What are you doing, Pei Song?

51
00:04:35,920 --> 00:04:37,040
Are you crazy?

52
00:04:39,159 --> 00:04:39,920
Song Shiya.

53
00:04:40,000 --> 00:04:41,120
I can divorce you.

54
00:04:41,240 --> 00:04:42,880
And I respect your choice.

55
00:04:43,080 --> 00:04:43,720
After the divorce,

56
00:04:43,720 --> 00:04:45,240
you can be with whoever you want.

57
00:04:45,240 --> 00:04:46,360
But as for Pei Ning,

58
00:04:47,240 --> 00:04:48,440
I will not allow it.

59
00:04:50,840 --> 00:04:52,370
That's a bit unreasonable.

60
00:04:52,640 --> 00:04:53,240
Why?

61
00:04:53,560 --> 00:04:54,280
I can't.

62
00:04:58,159 --> 00:05:00,080
Our Pei family is, after all,

63
00:05:00,080 --> 00:05:01,640
a prestigious enterprise.

64
00:05:01,760 --> 00:05:02,960
Every move we make

65
00:05:02,960 --> 00:05:05,320
is under the scrutiny of the media.

66
00:05:05,760 --> 00:05:07,600
If you get together with Song Shiya,

67
00:05:07,600 --> 00:05:09,000
what will the public say?

68
00:05:09,720 --> 00:05:13,920
The Pei family's younger brother-in-law and sister-in-law are together.

69
00:05:14,080 --> 00:05:15,560
People who don't know the truth

70
00:05:15,560 --> 00:05:16,920
will embellish the story.

71
00:05:16,920 --> 00:05:17,360
Do you know that?

72
00:05:17,360 --> 00:05:18,320
I don't mind.

73
00:05:18,440 --> 00:05:19,560
You might not mind,

74
00:05:19,600 --> 00:05:21,280
but what about the whole Pei family?

75
00:05:21,280 --> 00:05:22,480
And what about Shiya?

76
00:05:23,640 --> 00:05:24,520
Are you going to let her, a woman,

77
00:05:24,520 --> 00:05:26,120
bear all this gossip?

78
00:05:33,800 --> 00:05:34,930
I don't mind either.

79
00:05:38,680 --> 00:05:39,440
Shiya,

80
00:05:39,800 --> 00:05:40,600
don't...

81
00:05:45,600 --> 00:05:46,240
Brother.

82
00:05:48,320 --> 00:05:49,380
Since I was a child,

83
00:05:50,200 --> 00:05:51,560
whatever you said,

84
00:05:53,280 --> 00:05:54,320
I would do it.

85
00:05:55,960 --> 00:05:56,960
But not this time.

86
00:06:02,600 --> 00:06:03,280
No.

87
00:06:08,280 --> 00:06:08,960
Let's go.

88
00:06:09,080 --> 00:06:09,640
Shiya.

89
00:06:12,840 --> 00:06:13,520
Shiya.

90
00:06:13,880 --> 00:06:14,640
Pei Ning.

91
00:06:20,200 --> 00:06:22,130
How did a nice meal end up like this?

92
00:06:27,120 --> 00:06:29,320
Pei Song, you went a bit too far just now.

93
00:06:30,680 --> 00:06:32,740
You're staying to eat with me, right?

94
00:06:34,360 --> 00:06:35,360
Psycho.

95
00:06:58,800 --> 00:07:00,360
Sorry about just now.

96
00:07:01,520 --> 00:07:02,650
I lost control a bit.

97
00:07:04,040 --> 00:07:04,800
It's fine.

98
00:07:07,480 --> 00:07:08,200
Well,

99
00:07:08,960 --> 00:07:10,360
regarding my brother,

100
00:07:11,520 --> 00:07:13,650
do you really have no feelings for him?

101
00:07:14,360 --> 00:07:16,020
We are in a contract marriage.

102
00:07:16,520 --> 00:07:17,720
A contract marriage?

103
00:07:19,520 --> 00:07:21,320
When I was in college,

104
00:07:21,400 --> 00:07:22,720
my brother got into gambling debt.

105
00:07:22,720 --> 00:07:24,280
I had to drop out and work to pay it off.

106
00:07:24,280 --> 00:07:25,810
Later, I went on a blind date

107
00:07:26,480 --> 00:07:28,210
and unexpectedly met Pei Song.

108
00:07:29,760 --> 00:07:31,960
His grandfather was pressing him hard,

109
00:07:32,080 --> 00:07:33,610
so he came up with this idea.

110
00:07:41,000 --> 00:07:41,600
By the way.

111
00:07:42,000 --> 00:07:42,640
I...

112
00:07:42,760 --> 00:07:43,600
Tomorrow,

113
00:07:44,200 --> 00:07:45,920
my newly developed smart home system

114
00:07:45,920 --> 00:07:46,850
is going online.

115
00:07:47,159 --> 00:07:49,159
I want to hold a live-stream launch.

116
00:07:49,800 --> 00:07:50,320
Shiya.

117
00:07:52,600 --> 00:07:53,320
Can you

118
00:07:54,640 --> 00:07:55,600
join me?

119
00:07:58,080 --> 00:07:58,640
Sure.

120
00:07:58,800 --> 00:07:59,560
Where is it?

121
00:08:01,200 --> 00:08:02,600
I'll send it to you later.

122
00:08:19,640 --> 00:08:21,160
Family and friends watching the live stream,

123
00:08:21,160 --> 00:08:21,760
hello.

124
00:08:22,560 --> 00:08:23,290
I am Pei Ning.

125
00:08:24,240 --> 00:08:25,200
I'm glad you are all

126
00:08:25,200 --> 00:08:26,860
tuning in for my smart system.

127
00:08:27,400 --> 00:08:28,860
Actually, over the years,

128
00:08:29,040 --> 00:08:30,200
there has been someone

129
00:08:30,200 --> 00:08:31,960
silently encouraging me.

130
00:08:33,440 --> 00:08:34,280
Without her,

131
00:08:34,679 --> 00:08:36,610
this development wouldn't exist.

132
00:08:36,840 --> 00:08:38,200
She is like a star

133
00:08:38,640 --> 00:08:40,570
that lights up my entire night sky.

134
00:08:41,440 --> 00:08:42,169
Without her,

135
00:08:42,720 --> 00:08:44,650
I wouldn't have dared to dream big,

136
00:08:45,280 --> 00:08:46,200
nor would I have thought

137
00:08:46,200 --> 00:08:48,200
of exploring the smart home sector.

138
00:09:10,360 --> 00:09:11,000
Shiya.

139
00:09:12,120 --> 00:09:12,880
I love you.

140
00:09:18,200 --> 00:09:19,000
Marry me.

141
00:09:22,840 --> 00:09:23,520
Song Shiya,

142
00:09:23,760 --> 00:09:24,360
marry me.

143
00:09:24,360 --> 00:09:25,960
That's your sister-in-law.

144
00:09:32,480 --> 00:09:33,440
Pei Song.

145
00:09:41,080 --> 00:09:42,540
You're already divorced.

146
00:09:46,280 --> 00:09:46,880
Pei Song,

147
00:09:47,320 --> 00:09:47,640
do you know

148
00:09:47,640 --> 00:09:49,080
why I divorced you?

149
00:09:49,480 --> 00:09:50,800
Because you're arrogant

150
00:09:50,800 --> 00:09:52,560
and always act so superior.

151
00:09:53,360 --> 00:09:54,360
I'll say it again.

152
00:09:54,880 --> 00:09:56,440
We are already divorced.

153
00:10:28,760 --> 00:10:29,600
It looks like

154
00:10:29,680 --> 00:10:31,680
Pei Ning has already taken the bait.

155
00:10:36,680 --> 00:10:37,400
So,

156
00:10:37,840 --> 00:10:39,000
you are going to put on a show

157
00:10:39,000 --> 00:10:40,200
to provoke Pei Ning

158
00:10:40,320 --> 00:10:42,050
and force him to propose to you?

159
00:10:44,040 --> 00:10:45,720
The sooner I get together with him,

160
00:10:45,720 --> 00:10:47,580
the sooner I can find the evidence

161
00:10:47,680 --> 00:10:50,140
and save more people from becoming victims.

162
00:10:51,480 --> 00:10:53,080
Then what are you going to do?

163
00:11:04,080 --> 00:11:05,140
Does it still hurt?

164
00:11:10,120 --> 00:11:10,920
I'm fine.

165
00:11:13,520 --> 00:11:14,560
But to be honest,

166
00:11:14,800 --> 00:11:16,460
you went a bit too far that day.

167
00:11:16,600 --> 00:11:17,840
Given your personality,

168
00:11:17,840 --> 00:11:19,370
you wouldn't act like that.

169
00:11:21,200 --> 00:11:22,400
If it were in the past,

170
00:11:22,480 --> 00:11:23,940
I probably wouldn't have.

171
00:11:24,680 --> 00:11:25,640
But now I...

172
00:11:35,720 --> 00:11:37,050
What are you smiling at?

173
00:11:37,680 --> 00:11:41,000
I'm smiling because you also have moments of helplessness.

174
00:11:41,000 --> 00:11:42,760
It feels like no matter what you encounter,

175
00:11:42,760 --> 00:11:44,120
you remain calm

176
00:11:44,320 --> 00:11:45,120
and steady.

177
00:11:45,800 --> 00:11:46,680
It's as if anything

178
00:11:46,680 --> 00:11:47,840
can be solved by you.

179
00:11:48,720 --> 00:11:50,080
At a time like this,

180
00:11:50,080 --> 00:11:51,210
you can still smile.

181
00:11:51,480 --> 00:11:53,080
Is there really no other way?

182
00:11:57,600 --> 00:11:58,920
Are you jealous?

183
00:12:07,200 --> 00:12:08,200
What do you think?

184
00:13:21,640 --> 00:13:22,280
Shiya,

185
00:13:23,720 --> 00:13:24,850
when we got married,

186
00:13:25,320 --> 00:13:27,050
we didn't take wedding photos.

187
00:13:28,000 --> 00:13:29,480
Let's go take some tomorrow.
